# NOTE: Intentionally track the following as required by the review protocol:
# PLAN.md, AGENTS.md, MILESTONES.md, REVIEW.md, PROGRESS.md
# eval/splits/, eval/golden.json, reports/ (including live-test logs),
# and milestone traces/request-payload artifacts.
# Before committing payload artifacts, inspect them for secrets/sensitive data.
# Commit uv.lock and .python-version for reproducible builds.
